      "text": "**Interpreting noisy images**\n\nI’m working on interpreting noisy images, which are 9 slices stacked together. I need to focus on the central structure, looking for subtle differences in terms of shape and continuity. I suspect the central structure could be a vessel or a nodule, estimating its diameter based on measurements. I’ll analyze each image slice, zooming in conceptually on the central lesion, which might appear slightly darker. Additionally, I'll map out the center of each slice and look for any consistent patterns.",
