     },
     {
      "text": "**Estimating nodule diameter**\n\nThe nodule likely has a diameter of around 6 mm, appearing across about 5 to 7 of the slices. I see a potential trajectory in all 9 slices, which supports this estimate. The user specifically asks for an estimated diameter, so I need to respond with one word, then a sentence, followed by the diameter. I can’t forget to ensure the format is correct and to articulate any uncertainty, even if it's a medical context.",
